{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carcerem is a realistic first-person horror game. Step into the eerie corridors of an ancient labyrinth. From its depths come terrifying roars and sounds reminiscent of prisoners\u2019 screams. Explore the maze to uncover its mysteries \u2014 the deeper you go, the more dangerous it becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084530/extras/af95d7798488219c36dec72acfa9f168.poster.avif?t=1761204671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084530/extras/af95d7798488219c36dec72acfa9f168.webm?t=1761204671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084530/extras/af95d7798488219c36dec72acfa9f168.mp4?t=1761204671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, sent to the labyrinth as punishment for a crime, learns that anyone who escapes will be granted pardon. Determined to win his freedom, he\u2019s ready to fight no matter what it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The labyrinth is a stone prison built centuries ago. Thousands \u2014 perhaps tens of thousands \u2014 of prisoners have wandered through its halls over the ages, yet none have ever escaped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084530/extras/efeef14b22531a86128da6a008a6fc77.poster.avif?t=1761204671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084530/extras/efeef14b22531a86128da6a008a6fc77.webm?t=1761204671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084530/extras/efeef14b22531a86128da6a008a6fc77.mp4?t=1761204671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you can play through the opening segment of the game. Explore several locations and immerse yourself in the introductory story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle Solving. Ancient puzzles, devised and constructed centuries ago, will test your ingenuity and resourcefulness. Little is known about how they work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item and Clue Search. For a prisoner, nothing is more precious than a found item or clue. These may help you progress and bring you closer to solving the labyrinth\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084530/extras/5c26148f3169ed426ba3d178f19c763e.poster.avif?t=1761204671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084530/extras/5c26148f3169ed426ba3d178f19c763e.webm?t=1761204671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084530/extras/5c26148f3169ed426ba3d178f19c763e.mp4?t=1761204671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mysteries and Myths of the Labyrinth</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it even possible to escape? No newcomer knows the way out. You\u2019ll discover more in the full version of <i>Carcerem</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are the rumors true about the roars echoing from the labyrinth\u2019s depths? What creature has guarded it all this time?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are there any survivors still inside? If you meet them, how dangerous could that encounter be?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084530/extras/ae59b601aac5873bb0e633df57d898a4.poster.avif?t=1761204671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084530/extras/ae59b601aac5873bb0e633df57d898a4.webm?t=1761204671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084530/extras/ae59b601aac5873bb0e633df57d898a4.mp4?t=1761204671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084530?t=1761204671","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084530?t=1761204671","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084530/4f70030170449bcb8324aa65a1af7dee5c8874a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761204671","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084530/4f70030170449bcb8324aa65a1af7dee5c8874a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761204671","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Players will encounter dead bodies and gore"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carcerem is a realistic first-person horror game. Step into the eerie corridors of an ancient labyrinth. From its depths come terrifying roars and sounds reminiscent of prisoners\u2019 screams. Explore the maze to uncover 